  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given sets is:\n\n**Logic: (First term ÷ 2) + Second term = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(24, 9, 21)\n\n__(24 ____÷ 2)__ + 9 = 21\n\n__12 + 9__ = 21\n\n21 = 21\n\n(34, 16, 33)\n\n__**(34 **____**÷ 2)**__ + 16 = 33\n\n__**17 + 16**__ = 33\n\n33 = 33\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (34, 8, 28)\n\n__(34 ____÷ 2)__ + 8 = 28\n\n__17 + 8__ = 28\n\n25 ≠ 28\n\nOption 2) (53, 6, 34)\n\n__(53 ____÷ 2)__ + 6 = 34\n\n__26.5 + 6__ = 34\n\n32.5 ≠ 34\n\nOption 3) (43, 17, 41)\n\n__(43 ____÷ 2)__ + 17 = 41\n\n__21.5 + 17__ = 41\n\n38.5 ≠ 41\n\n**Option 4) (42, 9, 30)**\n\n__(42 ____÷ 2)__ + 9 = 30\n\n__21 + 9__ = 30\n\n**30 = 30**\n\nSo, **(42, 9, 30) follows the same pattern as the given sets.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
